DTSTART:20260224T180000Z
DTEND:20260224T200000Z
SUMMARY:Free Food/Stuff @ Paint Your Pet - RSVP FULL, WAITLIST ONLY
DESCRIPTION:Paint a custom paint-by-number of your favorite furry friend! No pet, no problem! Redbirds without pets may participate and paint Pawfficer Korg or Reggie!  Limited spots available. Participants MUST RSVP to this event AND submit a photo by February 6 to participate. Once you have RSVP'd, you will receive an email with a link to submit your photo. Both must be complete by February 6.   This event is hosted by Event Management, Dining, and Hospitality and Redbird Well.   If you need accommodation to fully participate in this program/event, please contact Event Management, Dining, and Hospitality at 309-438-8351 or EMDH@IllinoisState.edu. Please allow sufficient time to arrange the accommodation.
LOCATION:Brown Ballroom, Bone Student Center
END:VEVENT
